@model ShiftsAdminVm
@{ ViewBag.Title = "Shifts"; }
<div class="page-head"><div class="wrap"><h1>Volunteer shifts</h1><p style="margin:0;opacity:.85;">Publish the roster. Volunteers sign up from their dashboard, and a shift can never be overbooked.</p></div></div>
<partial name="_AdminSubNav" />
<div class="content wrap">
  <div class="panel-grid">
    <div>
      @if (Model.Shifts.Count == 0) { <div class="empty-hint">No upcoming shifts. Create one on the right.</div> }
      else
      {
        <div class="table-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Scrollable table">
        <table class="data-table">
          <thead><tr><th>When</th><th>Role</th><th>Filled</th><th>Volunteers</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
          @foreach (var s in Model.Shifts)
          {
            var start = ShelterTime.ToLocal(s.StartsAt);
            <tr>
              <td>@start.ToString("ddd d MMM, HH:mm")–@ShelterTime.ToLocal(s.EndsAt).ToString("HH:mm")</td>
              <td>@s.Role</td>
              <td class="mono"><span class="stamp @(s.IsFull ? "stamp-approved" : s.Filled == 0 ? "stamp-rejected" : "stamp-pending")">@s.Filled/@s.Capacity</span></td>
              <td style="font-size:.85rem;">@string.Join(", ", s.Signups.Select(x => x.Volunteer?.FullName))</td>
            </tr>
          }
          </tbody>
        </table>
        </div>
      }
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="form-card" style="max-width:none;">
        <h2 style="font-size:1.05rem;">Create a shift</h2>
        <form asp-action="CreateShift" method="post">
          <partial name="_ValidationSummary" />
          <div class="field"><label for="s-date">Date *</label><input id="s-date" type="date" name="NewShift.Date" value="@Model.NewShift.Date.ToString("yyyy-MM-dd")" required /></div>
          <div class="field-row">
            <div class="field"><label for="s-start">Start *</label><input id="s-start" type="time" name="NewShift.StartTime" value="@Model.NewShift.StartTime.ToString("HH:mm")" required /></div>
            <div class="field"><label for="s-end">End *</label><input id="s-end" type="time" name="NewShift.EndTime" value="@Model.NewShift.EndTime.ToString("HH:mm")" required /></div>
          </div>
          <div class="field-row">
            <div class="field"><label for="s-role">Role *</label><input id="s-role" name="NewShift.Role" value="@Model.NewShift.Role" list="shift-roles" required maxlength="60" />
              <datalist id="shift-roles">@foreach (var a in HourLogForm.Activities) { <option value="@a"></option> }</datalist></div>
            <div class="field"><label for="s-cap">Places *</label><input id="s-cap" type="number" min="1" max="50" name="NewShift.Capacity" value="@Model.NewShift.Capacity" required /></div>
          </div>
          <div class="field"><label for="s-notes">Notes</label><textarea id="s-notes" name="NewShift.Notes" maxlength="500">@Model.NewShift.Notes</textarea></div>
          <button class="btn btn-primary btn-block" type="submit">Create shift</button>
          <p class="hint" style="text-align:center;">Times are South African Standard Time.</p>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
